u&#x0364;ber die</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Theorie des Klanges</hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#g">von</hi><lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#g">Ern&#x017F;t Florens Friedrich Chladni</hi></docAuthor>,<lb/>
der Philo&#x017F;ophie und Rechte Doctor zu Wittenberg.</byline><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
